        {
          "text": " Jihadhari, usije ukamsahau BWANA, Mungu wako, kwa kutozishika amri zake, na hukumu zake, na sheria zake, ninazokuamuru leo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
